{"metadata":{"title":"Benchmarks","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"See how FirebladeECS revisions compare on a shared workload suite, and run the comparison yourself."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/benchmarks"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The benchmark suite measures the same workloads at several committed FirebladeECS revisions, such as a release tag against ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"main"},{"text":". The workloads cover entity creation, destruction and lookup, adding and removing components, iterating families, system updates and component events. Revisions with value-type components run each workload on both the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"archetype"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sparseSet"},{"text":" storage (see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage"},{"text":"), so a report also shows what the storage choice costs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"How-results-are-made-trustworthy","type":"heading","text":"How results are made trustworthy"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each revision is built once and measured in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"k"},{"text":" independent process replicates, interleaved in a seeded random order. The replicate is the unit of analysis: the centre value is the median of the replicate medians, with a distribution-free order-statistic 95% confidence interval. A speed-up against the baseline is the Hodges–Lehmann estimate with its exact confidence interval, tested with an exact Mann–Whitney test and adjusted across all comparisons of a report with Benjamini–Hochberg. A change counts as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"faster"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"slower"},{"text":" only when it is significant and clears the ±5% equivalence zone; an interval inside that zone is reported as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"equivalent"},{"text":", anything else as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inconclusive"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Read-and-reproduce","type":"heading","text":"Read and reproduce"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The latest published report: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/fireblade-engine.github.io\/ecs\/benchmarks\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Reports are published for dedicated benchmark releases only; the page shows the newest."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The 2.0.0 report: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/fireblade-engine.github.io\/ecs\/benchmarks\/2.0.0\/"},{"type":"text","text":", the full suite with 10 replicates on both storages. Its source is committed as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/BenchmarkReport.html"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The statistical design and workload parity notes: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To measure revisions locally, pass comma-separated tags, branches or commit IDs. Results are saved under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Benchmarks\/Results\/<UTC timestamp>\/"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["make benchmark-compare REFS=1.4.3,main:2.0.0 REPLICATES=10 BENCHMARK_FILTER='.*'","make benchmark-report RESULTS=\"Benchmarks\/Results\/<run>\/*.json\" REPORT_BASELINE=1.4.3"],"syntax":"sh","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BENCHMARK_FILTER"},{"text":" only 16 entities of every workload plus ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity.create.no-entities"},{"text":" (which only has 0 entities) run. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"make benchmark-report"},{"text":" renders the single file ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BenchmarkReport.html"},{"text":" from saved results and never runs benchmarks. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Benchmarks\/README.md"},{"text":" for all options.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEventMask":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The kinds of events a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","isActive":true},{"text":" subscribes to.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"NexusEventMask","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NexusEventMask","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NexusEventMask","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexuseventmask"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/StorageKind":{"title":"Nexus.StorageKind","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The storage a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps its entities and components in."}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus\/storagekind","role":"symbol"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ChoosingAStorage":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pick the sparse-set or the archetype storage for a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and know what changes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","role":"article","title":"Choosing a storage","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/choosingastorage"},"doc://Firebl